@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix schema: <http://schema.org/> .

# Declarations for the external vocabulary used by BIA's axioms, not imports
# of those vocabularies' semantics. Unknown external terms must fail the check.
schema:Action a owl:Class .
schema:CreativeWork a owl:Class .
schema:FundingScheme a owl:Class .
schema:Grant a owl:Class .
schema:MediaObject a owl:Class .
schema:Organization a owl:Class .
schema:Person a owl:Class .
<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000030> a owl:Class .
<http://www.w3.org/ns/csvw#Table> a owl:Class .

schema:name a owl:AnnotationProperty .
schema:citation a owl:ObjectProperty .
schema:result a owl:ObjectProperty .
schema:contentSize a owl:DatatypeProperty .
schema:description a owl:DatatypeProperty .
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> a owl:DatatypeProperty .
